# The working corpus — research, session handoffs, advisor lane, kickoffs.
# Untracked by design: it carries machine paths, install contents and the
# bench characterization, none of which belong in a public tree. Anything
# that must move in lockstep with the code lives in the tracked tree instead
# (see standards/RIPPERDOC_DOC_HYGIENE.md).
dev/

# Build output
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Worktrees. Every change is authored in one of these; they are checkouts of
# this same repository, not content of it.
.claude/worktrees/

# Editor / tooling
.obsidian/
.idea/
.vscode/
